          BoxShadow(
            color: Colors.black.withValues(alpha: 0.03),
            blurRadius: 10,
            offset: const Offset(0, 4),
          ),
        ],
      ),
      child: Column(
        crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
        children: [
          Text(
